**2 test files created, 1 stub file created:**

### Unit Tests (`apps/web/src/__tests__/linkifyAssets.test.ts`) — 15 tests
- **UNIT-001 through UNIT-009**: `linkifyAssetNames()` — marker wrapping, case-insensitive matching, length-descending sort, multiple occurrences, regex escaping, empty inputs, word boundaries
- **UNIT-010 through UNIT-012**: `extractAssetNames()` — deduplication, null/empty filtering, empty input
- **UNIT-013 through UNIT-015**: Edge cases — embedded word boundary, unmatched names passthrough, mixed matched/unmatched text
- **Result**: 9 failing, 6 passing (edge cases where no-op stub coincidentally satisfies assertion)

### Integration Tests (`apps/web/src/components/action-list/__tests__/MorningSummarySection.assetLinks.test.tsx`) — 15 tests
- **INT-001 through INT-009**: AC1 — clickable button rendering, scrollIntoView, highlight flash animation, multiple assets, markdown bold/list contexts, null/empty data graceful degradation, missing scroll target no-op
- **INT-010 through INT-014**: AC2 — Ctrl+click opens new tab, Cmd+click (metaKey), Ctrl+click doesn't scroll, correct action ID routing, duplicate asset name first-match
- **INT-015**: AC3 — unmatched text renders as plain text
- **Result**: 13 failing, 2 passing (null/empty action data tests pass since stub produces no links)

### Stub File (`apps/web/src/lib/linkifyAssets.ts`)
- Minimal no-op implementations of `linkifyAssetNames()` and `extractAssetNames()` so tests can compile and fail at assertion level (standard TDD practice)
- Existing MorningSummarySection tests (Story 17.2) remain passing — no regressions
